DERIVED CONTENT FROM THE UPSTREAM SKILL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This plugin is a companion UI and toolset for the SolidWorks Automation Skill.
Its knowledge base (prompt scaffolding, template presets, tips, delivery gates
and the nine-phase design outline under content/, catalog.js and generate.js)
was distilled from that project's documentation and scripts.

